        <summary>
          <para>Encounter order follows a defined sort order. <see cref="P:Java.Util.ISpliterator.Comparator" /> returns the associated comparator, or <see langword="null" /> if all elements are comparable and sorted by their natural order. A spliterator that reports <c>Sorted</c> must also report <see cref="F:Java.Util.SpliteratorCharacteristics.Ordered" />.</para>
